<title>USA: Circon to review US Surgical offer.</title>
<headline>Circon to review US Surgical offer.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Circon Corp said Tuesday its board of directors will review &quot;in due course&quot; U.S. Surgical Corp's $16.50 per share tender offer for all Circon shares.</p>
<p>Circon makes products for minimally invasive urological and gynecological surgery.</p>
